            "review_title": "Review at Nha Hang Long De",
            "review_text": "Hanoi G\nHanoi, Vietnam17 contributions\n0\nA good place for trying and tasting the unique famous dish from Ninh Binh province BUT in Hanoi capital.\nOct 2019\nNinh Binh is a very famous place by Trang An Eco, Hoa Lu ancient capital, Bai Dinh pagoda, Cuc Phuong national park....But other side of this beautiful & attractive land, it is about the local foods: goat meat, fried rice, fresh vegetables.... Now you no need travel so far over 100KM to Ninh Binh province for tasting these all delicious foods. You could come to this restaurant, only 5KM away from Hanoi Old town.\n- Local Ninh Binh foods, fresh meats & vegetables... all you could have it here.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 18, 2019",
